Recommended first build

Don't attempt all 17 engines simultaneously. Build BTECH FUTURE OS v1 around five foundations:

Identity & multi-tenant business system
AI Business Generator
AI Agent Factory
Workflow Engine
Website/API/App Generator

Then plug BTECH-TV / Media Engine into it as the first major application.

That gives you an actual platform architecture that can grow into the larger BTECH FUTURE OS ecosystem, rather than another standalone website.
